 "name_en": "Integration with External Tax Calculation Engines (43D)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Integration with External Tax Calculation Engines (43D)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio51f106977aad482c9977a89ee2027592\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio51f106977aad482c9977a89ee2027592__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">You can integrate external tax calculation engines into <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> within pricing, using SAP Cloud Integration as middleware. Within the pricing and tax procedure, a specific condition (using a condition value formula) collects data from the transaction and context, builds a payload, sends the payload to the SAP Cloud Integration, and receives a response from it. The taxes calculated and returned in the response payload are mapped back to the pricing structures of the tax conditions.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio51f106977aad482c9977a89ee2027592__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Procure materials and services</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Sell materials and service</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform operations trace check</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio51f106977aad482c9977a89ee2027592__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Centralize services</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Facilitate processes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce maintenance</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve compliance</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage calculations</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>与外部税收计算引擎的集成 (43D)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio51f106977aad482c9977a89ee2027592\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio51f106977aad482c9977a89ee2027592__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">您可以使用 SAP Cloud Integration 作为中间件，在定价过程中将外部税收计算引擎集成到 SAP <span class=\"ph pname\">S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 中。在定价和税收程序中，特定条件（使用条件值公式）从事务和上下文收集数据，构建有效负载，将有效负载发送到 SAP Cloud Integration 并从中接收响应。在响应有效负载中计算和返回的税款，将映射回税款条件的定价结构。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio51f106977aad482c9977a89ee2027592__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">采购物料和服务</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">销售物料和服务</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行操作跟踪检查</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio51f106977aad482c9977a89ee2027592__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">集中服务</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">促进流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">减少维护</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提高合规性</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理计算</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
